  "title": "AXIL Brands to Introduce GSX 3.0 and XCOR Pro Hearing Protection Products Nationwide at Sportsman’s Warehouse",
  "summary": "Los Angeles, CA – March 30, 2026 – AXIL Brands, Inc. (NYSE American: AXIL), a leader in innovative hearing protection and enhancement technology, today announced that it will introduce two of its flagship electronic hearing protection products, the GSX 3.0 and XCOR Pro to Sportsman’s Warehouse stores nationwide. The rollout to Sportsman’s Warehouse stores is expected to begin in the coming weeks, with both products available in-store and online at Sportsmans.com.",
